            <div xml:id="m-073938fc-3918-48f3-8095-4701b3b0e766">
              <lg xml:id="m-7ab73f0f-6685-475e-bc36-9657190e7421">
                <l xml:id="m-271d3810-a76e-4bc3-81f2-3a39e95fc004" facs="#m-1f4ea7ff-41cb-42c9-aefd-199cbc38905f" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-5e4e8119-d13f-401b-92b7-e4285f395ecd" facs="#m-fa7b2713-0c70-476a-b779-c15c362afab4" label="ambiguous">870</l><l xml:id="m-dc0b7f92-1ad8-4ec4-8a01-9fd5f89d8db8" facs="#m-26136ffd-e93e-474b-b0e4-0a6ec524aeec" label="ambiguous">alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-2dd827a7-e648-4462-8242-d4c716378e08" facs="#m-06c98ea6-d0b8-4112-ad90-42a57a1559a0" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia. Ps. Exsúrgat Dé-us, et dissipéntur in-imí-ci</l><l xml:id="m-7e26eb7c-f22b-47ef-9dbf-c43a94b837b4" facs="#m-34730df5-4559-4cbd-8b65-3043359cf526" label="lyrics-like">éjus:" et fúgi-ant, qui odérunt é-um, a fá-ci-e éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-269b1d5e-2e7e-48b3-83b2-29029d9131f2" facs="#m-d61ea061-a09b-4de3-8fb0-964636b3e3e8" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-890c4fbc-5221-4245-a6ce-9a78d09483ae" facs="#m-51c2c68f-ba4e-4ddc-8ad9-c193a6d7328b" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-38aad972-1148-4fa6-8526-ec3747aa1fa5" facs="#m-9a76acbd-5c06-4f40-a63e-51dfafa4f257" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-bada3708-0b5a-46f1-af78-227340f25074" facs="#m-bb7977e8-a9fe-4b6b-8a1f-1898c81e7766" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui hodiérna die corda fidé¬ semper consolatióne gaudére. Per</l><l xml:id="m-8aae1489-d1af-41e9-9189-a4b8676f4bd6" facs="#m-ae017d1f-3338-4ee2-9eda-aa46cdcb3a58" label="lyrics-like">lium Sancti Spiritus illustratió¬</l><l xml:id="m-476039ce-376e-4e4f-9624-ecaa1430f1d6" facs="#m-eab6912b-d2f9-45d5-ae61-708fdc124db0" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum... in unitáte ejúsdem Spt¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c4e1f0d-423a-4de9-aa1f-ff5daaebdc02" facs="#m-c39d59ff-0274-4f01-a4d2-7e4ebaacb759" label="lyrics-like">ne docuisti:t da nobis in eódem</l><l xml:id="m-b4c6206f-408b-4f53-b159-7cf5503c3ce3" facs="#m-bf4f3628-c143-45e0-9165-df7861e831e2" label="ambiguous">ritus Sancti Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-ca302813-0b17-4b6f-a9f8-2d5e1299e94b" facs="#m-c7f3f314-86bd-469f-b62c-e5b8989025a0" label="lyrics-like">Spíritu recta sápere, “et de ejus</l><l xml:id="m-e5082bee-1dbd-46ac-acad-81d937c8bc7b" facs="#m-e47fc04d-7190-465b-92a4-44a6e9ebb21f" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act.2</l><l xml:id="m-7c6c680d-b9af-4841-9ee9-9752a2c53a08" facs="#m-f133ac84-8b94-45ec-a9d0-c43a0be5b56e" label="lyrics-like">VUM compleréntur dies Pentecó- quóniam audiébat unusquisque lin¬</l><l xml:id="m-127d807f-edc9-4d74-b900-4f3c1ea6e8ce" facs="#m-7452ebb1-3c76-4bc3-bcfe-8f425b38373a" label="lyrics-like">Lstes, erant omnes discípuli pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-624cca70-8f4b-4374-9dc4-d9585ede3fa9" facs="#m-689712dc-ee56-40ab-92ab-03647773adbf" label="lyrics-like">gua sua illos loquéntes. Stupébant</l><l xml:id="m-4c65bb42-3536-4a57-b172-4f1918fbef8b" facs="#m-88a0f3dc-9455-48fa-a1e5-cff4c71505f7" label="lyrics-like">riter in códem loco: et factus est</l><l xml:id="m-a9b245e7-06a6-4d58-bfb2-7e08545637c7" facs="#m-e7ff5489-061e-4382-9910-7a0ad1a7f1bb" label="lyrics-like">autem omnes, et mirabántur, dicén¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ed2aaec-1286-419a-9467-2efab3db7610" facs="#m-53f2688c-0245-4f97-aef8-9fa2d24ebb44" label="lyrics-like">repénte de caelo sonus, tamquam</l><l xml:id="m-d5573b5a-0a8f-414d-9c2d-eee19191b9b9" facs="#m-2a640962-1881-4197-8534-b671832c2630" label="ambiguous">tes: Nonne ecce omnes isti, qui</l><l xml:id="m-2a8d7ad5-5679-4dcb-ad11-21a95531ea9f" facs="#m-037482ef-aafc-4ee1-ad92-0b6f104c3df6" label="lyrics-like">adveniéntis spiritus veheméntis:</l><l xml:id="m-eb8c8911-d642-4741-a5ae-9c2a58558fc3" facs="#m-f1dc22e4-66e0-482d-ad03-7e9c4ec7724a" label="lyrics-like">toquúntur, Galilaéi sunt? Et quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-fad2992f-1b90-4d32-ab17-49dfc289323e" facs="#m-becd2866-407b-4753-b13b-4b5e3fe9346b" label="lyrics-like">et replévit totam domum ubi erant</l><l xml:id="m-6b570d94-d0e9-4f5c-a61c-2cddb421b560" facs="#m-941575f9-2729-404e-97c8-d909dbbf41ec" label="lyrics-like">modo nos audívimus unusquísque</l><l xml:id="m-d5487e18-2777-4503-86da-29f91093b5f0" facs="#m-be1238a9-da97-412b-bc30-6d3f61f91a1c" label="lyrics-like">sedéntes. Et apparuérunt illis di¬</l><l xml:id="m-945ee036-9b7c-4f28-84a4-9f0155d96524" facs="#m-39517396-a197-4f05-bc47-bb984ba3d646" label="ambiguous">linguam nostram, in qua nati su¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b195667-da79-4302-bf3a-8d632580be96" facs="#m-9fb87bad-e866-4506-9557-0a05f37e2eef" label="ambiguous">spertitae linguae tamquam ignis,</l><l xml:id="m-61c28288-b343-4dc7-a591-a1d0908fd875" facs="#m-cd7257f8-408a-4425-a310-cd2d8e8fcc34" label="lyrics-like">mus? Parthi, et Medi, et Aelamítae,</l><l xml:id="m-9918b298-7988-4e23-8c48-e9b8db6cdb6c" facs="#m-01b69305-2798-468b-87dd-890e4180804d" label="lyrics-like">et qui hábitant Mesopotámiam, Iu¬</l><l xml:id="m-82969460-5a03-410f-ae29-692f0e55b572" facs="#m-cdc4b1ee-d13b-4cfb-9133-c024aae55a21" label="lyrics-like">seditque supra síngulos eórum : et</l><l xml:id="m-3e99f035-a373-4cc7-beda-36e4870b2f94" facs="#m-9d7ef5f7-5c4d-4275-837d-07d5b7e0f72b" label="lyrics-like">repléti sunt omnes Spíritu Sancto,</l><l xml:id="m-298fbcc2-0497-47d2-8997-2b82c1a6865e" facs="#m-27b92f41-c18d-4f99-b38b-040363e02b81" label="lyrics-like">daéam, et Cappadóciam, Pontum,</l><l xml:id="m-b6b8be31-de40-456f-a45e-b09d8b93444d" facs="#m-23987a72-a9a1-4cb6-9669-5a3a7a47e86b" label="ambiguous">et Asiam, Phrygiam, et Pamphy¬</l><l xml:id="m-17f7aa56-abb1-4b7a-9e3e-f87de1f76d48" facs="#m-98d7ba37-0fac-496f-bd66-3112acfe3e66" label="lyrics-like">et coepérunt loqui váriis linguis,</l><l xml:id="m-38324184-942d-42e2-b29d-ad8825cc1c09" facs="#m-08fc15fe-6af3-4e74-9b75-55bcb67ed5eb" label="ambiguous">liam, Aegyptum, et partes Libyae,</l><l xml:id="m-02a76dc8-affc-4adc-8760-d69e7929f01d" facs="#m-9e51e047-42a6-4bfe-b28e-27fbf89da87d" label="lyrics-like">prout Spiritus Sanctus dabat éloqui</l><l xml:id="m-072cb6fd-6907-433a-a268-476fdd2306f8" facs="#m-d7dda724-8e25-4b7e-b722-e3653aabad6a" label="lyrics-like">illis. Erant autem in Ierúsalem ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-a21e734e-64e8-480d-895b-df13807ed8a7" facs="#m-23979abd-8840-4605-bc65-a0b865e785d9" label="lyrics-like">quae est circa Cyrénen, et ádvenae</l><l xml:id="m-eab287e6-2504-4aa8-89cd-eb7797c3bf92" facs="#m-623e03fd-0a89-4d25-a04c-6b45a12c470d" label="lyrics-like">Románi, Judaéi quoque, et Prosé¬</l><l xml:id="m-56e1e45d-50e8-4f17-98e0-48020ee22aef" facs="#m-52ab24d2-b440-46dd-9171-35ba16145fc5" label="lyrics-like">bitántes Judaéi, viri religiósi ex</l><l xml:id="m-3be22f88-0b9a-4603-8f3e-743de57d91e3" facs="#m-a3a55fde-d112-49ad-8d7f-31d10376c7b3" label="lyrics-like">lyti, Cretes, et Arabes: audívimus</l><l xml:id="m-f89d489a-f84c-40a4-b070-13ccab99446a" facs="#m-c7d326cb-02f0-4e65-a47a-7136bbccbb7b" label="lyrics-like">omni natióne, quae sub caelo est.</l><l xml:id="m-dffc3851-f327-414b-88f3-2c8a235f7710" facs="#m-63d235e7-669c-48e3-8552-31d286758012" label="lyrics-like">cos loquéntes nostris linguis magná¬</l><l xml:id="m-6a4b8f26-250e-42f2-955c-2c951d54c542" facs="#m-edeffbc7-fcb5-4a55-925f-d1d9e7bd5e78" label="lyrics-like">Facta autem hac voce, convénit</l><l xml:id="m-42e98c9c-c5b4-49d6-a62a-756eebb89a96" facs="#m-811c8c6e-3580-4089-b0a0-7fc071b1d4b0" label="lyrics-like">multitúdo, et mente confúsa est, llia Dei¬</l><l xml:id="m-1aa84d78-2f6e-4bbe-9f3f-2aed5971e5cb" facs="#m-ddf6aa32-9c4b-46a5-a28f-2fa79e955673" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-6ca18b92-3166-4d3c-84d5-b3af0a89bfb3" facs="#m-7773d973-a90b-484f-85a1-8e4af0a98dee" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú¬ ia.</l><l xml:id="m-5cafcc8e-abec-49c8-b6fc-0f4591ec12f9" facs="#m-9bc77d58-4968-45ed-aadd-7a5f1f4a89f0" label="ambiguous">V. Emit-te</l><l xml:id="m-ae78ee5c-d65d-488c-b984-a5bc7ef2b89e" facs="#m-3d77f973-b0a2-4a4d-a346-a079d2b0db00" label="ambiguous">ij.</l><l xml:id="m-60cb9be9-db6f-44cb-906f-b46c2497151a" facs="#m-5072a563-f07c-44e3-bb1f-4d76e6fe9a66" label="lyrics-like">Spí-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb26ac76-d3b2-43c6-a49d-9a12ead3ad63" facs="#m-b727b315-4c61-49f9-8859-137a8c54e022" label="lyrics-like">et cre-a- bún¬</l><l xml:id="m-c950d819-1ce8-46ce-a01a-e7c58e675cc1" facs="#m-91f11266-1fe7-4e5f-9d75-2618695c2b27" label="lyrics-like">tum tú¬ um,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>